{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02870","headline":"戏赠潘徐城门迎两新妇 · 李百药","name":"戏赠潘徐城门迎两新妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦晋称旧匹，潘徐有世亲。\n三星宿已会，四德婉而嫔。\n霞光鬓里薄，月影扇中新。\n年华与妆面，共作一芳春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02870.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02870","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}